# Linger

> Linger runs authentic, low-density, quiet, pet-friendly homestays and farm stays across Coorg, near Bangalore, Bandipur, Chikmagalur and the Himalayas (Uttarakhand). Delightfully local weekends. Enquire for dates; there is no instant online checkout.

Contact: stay@linger.in, +91-959-005-0001, WhatsApp +91-854-806-5772. Website: https://linger.in/

